cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the derived dataset, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "biblical-studies-books-mining: reproducible K10plus harvesting for a Biblical Studies bibliography"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible, resumable extraction of Biblical Studies candidate records from the K10plus union
  catalogue, with pandas-ready Parquet bibliography. Nine configured searches (DDC 22*, LCC BS*,
  GND and LCSH subject headings, title supplements) harvested in full: 525,205 distinct records
  (2026-11-18), of which 300,542 textual monographs. Exports include structured contributors with
  relator codes, parsed life dates, GND identifiers, and subject concepts merged across German–English
  vocabularies. See EXTRACTION.md for coverage, search contributions, and limitations.
authors:
  - family-names: "Kaše"
    given-names: "Vojtěch"
    affiliation: "Department of Philosophy, Faculty of Arts, University of West Bohemia"
    orcid: "0000-0002-6601-1605"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-18"
